uob-ladys-solitaire.l4:1403:1-1429:53:
  `Rate answer` OF 2, 2, Verified, 4, 4, 4, FALSE, TRUE, (Cap OF "Solitaire — Dining", TRUE, 750, `Calendar month`, `By posting date`), (LIST "Counted in your Dining Preferred Rewards Category (Schedule 1).", "The S$750 cap is PER CATEGORY and does not transfer: unused room in your other Preferred Rewards Category cannot be spent here (cl.6(b)).", "Your categories are the ones registered for this Quarter at uob.com.sg/ladys-enrol; a change made now applies from the following Quarter (cl.5).", "Schedule 1 categorises by the merchant's MCC, and UOB disclaims it: a merchant's registered MCC may not match its nature of business, so UOB cannot guarantee this transaction falls in your category.", "cl.32 withholds UNI$ for twenty-two kinds of transaction. Seventeen of them are tested here from the kind of posting this is; five are not, because no fact in this corpus records them: NETS-rail transactions, prepaid-account top-ups, brokerage and securities, gambling and trading, and amounts approved under the UOB Payment Facility. cl.34 reaches some of those by MCC instead (6540 stored value, 6211 securities, 7995 gambling), and cl.32(v) lets UOB exclude anything else without notice.", "cl.35 also excludes any line beginning NORWDS (wef 21 Jul 2024), and this corpus has no way to recognise one, so a NORWDS transaction earns here and would earn nothing at UOB. Every other gap in this module understates what you earn; this one overstates it.", "UNI$ are computed on the date the transaction is POSTED to UOB's systems, not the date you spent (cl.8).", "UNI$ convert to KrisFlyer or Asia miles in blocks of 10,000 miles, so UNI$ below a whole block buy nothing yet (cl.3).", "Your Card account must be in good standing and not cancelled, or no UNI$ is earned (cl.9, cl.36).", "A Lady's Savings Account uplift above 4 miles per S$1 is NOT in this document and is unconfirmed here. What the held T&C states is 10X UNI$ per S$5, which is 4 miles per S$1."), (LIST Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "A (heading)", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "A. Preferred Rewards Category(ies) Spending – 10X UNI$ per S$5 spent (equivalent to 4 miles per S$1 spent)", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "2(b)", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "“Base UNI$” means the reward of UNI$1 for every S$5.00 spent (equivalent to 0.4 miles per S$1 spent) by a UOB Lady’s Card principal cardholder (“you” or “Cardmember”) on a Card, as posted on UOB’s systems.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "2(c)", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "“Bonus UNI$” means the bonus reward of 9X UNI$ per S$5 spent (equivalent to 3.6 miles per S$1 spent) by you, in addition to the Base UNI$, as posted on UOB’s systems.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "3", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "UNI$ can be converted to KrisFlyer or Asia miles (in blocks of 10,000 miles) at the conversion rate of UNI$1 = 2 miles.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "4(b)", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "UOB Lady’s Solitaire Card and UOB Lady’s Solitaire Metal Card Cardmembers can select two Preferred Rewards Categories. You will be eligible to earn Bonus UNI$ for every S$5.00 of spending in your Preferred Rewards Categories in accordance with these Terms and Conditions.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "5", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "To select your Preferred Rewards Category(ies) to earn Bonus UNI$, you must first register via uob.com.sg/ladys-enrol. You may change your selection each Quarter. ... If you do not select or change your Preferred Rewards Category(ies) for the next Quarter, the current selected category(s) shall continue to apply in the next Quarter.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "6(b)", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "With effect from 1 August 2025, if you hold a Lady’s Solitaire Card, 2,700 UNI$ (which is equivalent to S$1,500 spent), with each Preferred Rewards Category capped at 1,350 UNI$ (which is equivalent to S$750 spent).", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "8", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "For the avoidance of doubt, any Base UNI$ and Bonus UNI$ that may be awarded for any transactions charged to your Card will be computed based on the date that the transaction is posted on UOB’s systems.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "Schedule 1", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "Transaction categories are automatically categorised according to the Merchant Category Code (MCC). The MCC determines whether the transaction is eligible for Bonus UNI$ under each category. ... A merchant’s registered MCC may not always correspond with its nature of business. Therefore, we cannot guarantee that a transaction will fall within your selected Preferred Rewards Category(ies) to qualify Bonus UNI$."), Verified
uob-ladys-solitaire.l4:1431:1-1457:53:
  `Rate answer` OF 0, 2, Verified, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, (Cap OF "Solitaire — nothing earned", FALSE, 0, `Calendar month`, `By posting date`), (LIST "No UNI$ at all, and not only the Bonus UNI$: cl.32, cl.34 and cl.35 are each drafted over bare UNI$, so a transaction any one of them reaches earns neither the Base UNI$ nor the Bonus UNI$.", "Withheld by cl.35: this transaction's description is on the excluded list.", "cl.32 withholds UNI$ for twenty-two kinds of transaction. Seventeen of them are tested here from the kind of posting this is; five are not, because no fact in this corpus records them: NETS-rail transactions, prepaid-account top-ups, brokerage and securities, gambling and trading, and amounts approved under the UOB Payment Facility. cl.34 reaches some of those by MCC instead (6540 stored value, 6211 securities, 7995 gambling), and cl.32(v) lets UOB exclude anything else without notice.", "cl.35 also excludes any line beginning NORWDS (wef 21 Jul 2024), and this corpus has no way to recognise one, so a NORWDS transaction earns here and would earn nothing at UOB. Every other gap in this module understates what you earn; this one overstates it.", "UNI$ are computed on the date the transaction is POSTED to UOB's systems, not the date you spent (cl.8).", "UNI$ convert to KrisFlyer or Asia miles in blocks of 10,000 miles, so UNI$ below a whole block buy nothing yet (cl.3).", "Your Card account must be in good standing and not cancelled, or no UNI$ is earned (cl.9, cl.36).", "A Lady's Savings Account uplift above 4 miles per S$1 is NOT in this document and is unconfirmed here. What the held T&C states is 10X UNI$ per S$5, which is 4 miles per S$1."), (LIST Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "32", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "UNI$ will not be awarded for: a) Bill payment (where applicable); b) NETS and NETS-related transactions; c) 0% Instalment Payment Plans; d) SmartPay; e) Personal loans; f) Online money transfers g) Balance/funds transfers; h) Cash advances; i) Fees; j) Interests; k) Finance charges; l) Late payment charges; m) Annual fee charges ; n) Reversals; o) Void card transactions p) Chargebacks q) Payment of funds to prepaid accounts, including top-ups for any pre-paid card; r) Transactions relating to brokerage / securities; s) Any gambling related transactions, any trading transactions (including but not limited to websites for trading of shares and cryptocurrency); t) UOB Lady’s LuxePay Plans (if applicable) u) amounts approved under the UOB Payment Facility and any associated fees or chargers (w.e.f. 19 June 2023); v) Other financial charges and any other transactions we may exclude from time to time without prior notice.", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "34", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "UNI$ will not be awarded for the following Merchant Transaction Codes:", Provenance OF "uob-ladys-cards-tnc", "35", "Updated in August 2025 (Version 1.1)", (DATE OF 1, 8, 2025), "You will also not earn UNI$ for transactions with the following transaction descriptions:"), Verified
